        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 0372, Double Cylinder Grade 2 Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWeslock's 0372 Double Cylinder Deadbolt contains two hardened steel rollers to prevent intruders from sawing through the bolt to gain entry. This Traditionale Collection Deadbolt features two five pin cylinders with a 1 inch throw and a heavy duty security strike with 3 inch screws. A Double Cylinder is key operated from both outside and inside. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both the exterior and the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-deadbolt-weslock-0371\"><b>Traditionale Collection Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Weslock Grade 2 Double Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Heavy duty security strike with 3\" screws.</li>\r\n<li>5-pin cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>1\" throw deadbolt with two hardened steel rollers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Limited 10 year finish warranty.</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime PVD finish on exterior polished brass.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</P>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Weslock Grade 2 Double Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" with removable faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable from 1-3/8\" to 2\".</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
